          "currency": "USD",
          "description": "Custom Odoo ERP / Inventory System Requirements\nProject Overview\n\nWe are looking for a consultant/developer to build and customize a self-hosted Odoo system (Enterprise or Community, depending on which is most suitable) for inventory management, order processing, shipping tracking, and financial reporting.\n\nThe system should be streamlined and user-friendly, with unnecessary Odoo modules removed or hidden. The goal is to create a focused operational platform rather than a full ERP environment.\n\nInfrastructure & Security\nHosting\nSelf-hosted on our own server or VPS.\nHosted under our own domain.\nFull control over infrastructure and data.\nNo dependency on vendor-hosted services unless required for specific integrations.\nSecurity\nEncrypted connections (SSL/TLS).\nSecure user authentication.\nUser roles and permissions.\nActivity logging and audit trail.\nAbility to track user sessions and actions.\nLogin System\n\nSimple login interface with:\n\nUsername/email\nPassword\nUser roles\nOptional 2FA support\n\nThe system should not be publicly accessible without authentication.\n\nOrder Management\nManual Order Entry\n\nOrders are received externally and entered manually by staff.\n\nRequirements:\n\nFast order creation workflow.\nNo automatic customer emails required.\nCustomer information stored internally.\nAbility to update order status manually.\n\nSuggested order statuses:\n\nPending\nProcessing\nPacked\nShipped\nDelivered\nCompleted\nDisputed\nCancelled\nInventory Management\nCore Requirement\n\nWe sell products that originate from a common bulk inventory source but are sold under multiple labels, brands, and package sizes.\n\nExample\n\nMaster Product:\n\nCreatine Bulk Stock\nCurrent Stock: 50,000g\n\nSellable Products:\n\nAMA Creatine 100g\nAMA Creatine 250g\nAMA Creatine 500g\nBrand B Creatine 100g\nBrand B Creatine 250g\n\nWhen a product is sold:\n\nAMA Creatine 100g deducts 100g from Creatine Bulk Stock.\nAMA Creatine 250g deducts 250g from Creatine Bulk Stock.\nBrand B Creatine 500g deducts 500g from Creatine Bulk Stock.\n\nAll child products should consume inventory from the same parent stock pool.\n\nInventory Features\nMultiple warehouses.\nInventory adjustments.\nStock movement history.\nProduct cost tracking.\nLow stock alerts.\nDetailed inventory reporting.\nShipping & Tracking\nShipment Handling\n\nTracking numbers are entered manually after shipment.\n\nRequirements:\n\nTracking number field on each order.\nShipment history.\nShipping status tracking.\nTracking Integration\n\nIntegrate with:\n\nAfterShip (preferred)\nAlternative tracking providers if more suitable\n\nThe dashboard should display:\n\nCurrent shipment status\nTracking updates\nDelivered status\nFailed delivery notifications\nCryptocurrency Order Tracking\nRequirement\n\nSome orders are paid through cryptocurrency escrow systems.\n\nThe cryptocurrency value may fluctuate between order placement and order completion.\n\nExample\n\nOrder placed:\n\n0.10 BTC\nBTC value at order creation: $150\n\nOrder completed:\n\nBTC value at completion: $180\n\nor\n\nBTC value at completion: $120\n\nThe system should record:\n\nCrypto amount\nFiat value at order creation\nFiat value at order completion\nGain/loss due to price movement\nOrder Completion Logic\n\nOrder completion should occur when:\n\nShipment is delivered/picked up\n\nHowever:\n\nOrders can later enter dispute status.\nDisputed orders should no longer be counted as completed until resolved.\nCost & Fee Tracking\n\nWe need detailed tracking of operational costs.\n\nShipping Handler Fees\n\nEach order includes a commission paid to a shipping provider.\n\nRequirements:\n\nRecord shipping commission per order.\nTrack total shipping costs.\nReport shipping profitability.\nMarketing Fees\n\nTrack marketing costs as either:\n\nPercentage of order value\nFixed amount\n\nStore separately for reporting.\n\nPlatform Fees\n\nTrack platform fees as:\n\nPercentage of order value\nFixed amount\n\nStore separately for reporting.\n\nFinancial Reporting\n\nThe system should clearly show:\n\nRevenue\nCost of goods sold\nShipping fees\nMarketing fees\nPlatform fees\nNet profit\nDashboard & Analytics\n\nProvide visual reporting including:\n\nSales Analytics\nSales by product\nSales by brand\nSales by category\nSales by date range\nInventory Analytics\nCurrent stock levels\nInventory value\nFast-moving products\nLow-stock products\nFinancial Analytics\nRevenue\nProfit\nFees\nShipping costs\nCrypto gains/losses\n\nUse interactive charts and graphs where possible.\n\nUser Interface\nGeneral Design Goals\n\nThe interface should feel lighter and more approachable than standard Odoo.\n\nDesired style:\n\nDark theme\nModern UI\nClean dashboards\nSimple navigation\nReduced ERP complexity\n\nOptional (budget permitting):\n\nCustom branding\nTeddy bear themed design elements\nFriendly illustrations/icons\nSubtle animations and micro-interactions\n\nThe objective is to create a system that feels modern, enjoyable to use, and easy for staff to learn.\n\nConsultant Recommendation Request\n\nPlease provide:\n\nRecommended Odoo version (Community vs Enterprise)\nEstimated development time\nEstimated implementation cost\nSuggested third-party integrations\nLong-term maintenance requirements\nAny alternative architecture you believe would better suit these requirements",
