          "description": "Hi,\n\nI’m a solo founder from Sweden building Runda, a fintech startup focused on making saving money effortless.\n\nThe concept is simple:\n\nUsers connect their bank account through Open Banking, and every card purchase is automatically rounded up to the nearest whole amount. The spare change is then accumulated as savings.\n\nExample:\n\n* €4.60 purchase\n* Rounded to €5.00\n* €0.40 saved automatically\n\nThe goal is to help people build savings habits without changing their lifestyle.\n\n⸻\n\nCurrent Stage\n\nI have:\n\n* Product vision and roadmap\n* Pitch deck\n* Initial MVP specification\n* Market research completed\n* Research on Open Banking providers (Tink, Nordigen, etc.)\n\nI am now looking for a technical partner to help build the first MVP and shape the product from the ground up.\n\n⸻\n\nWhat I Am Looking For\n\nIdeally someone who:\n\n* Has experience with React / Next.js\n* Can work with APIs and backend systems\n* Understands authentication and security\n* Has an interest in fintech\n* Wants to build a startup, not just complete a project\n\nThis could begin as a freelance engagement but my goal is to find someone interested in becoming a long-term technical co-founder.\n\n⸻\n\nMVP Scope\n\nPhase 1:\n\n* User onboarding\n* Savings dashboard\n* Round-up calculation engine\n* Transaction history\n* Savings goals\n* Responsive mobile-friendly design\n\nInitially, the MVP can use simulated transactions before integrating Open Banking.\n\n⸻\n\nTech Stack (Flexible)\n\n* Next.js\n* TypeScript\n* Tailwind\n* Supabase\n* Vercel\n\nOpen to suggestions.\n\n⸻\n\nWhy Join?\n\nI am not looking for someone to simply write code.\n\nI am looking for a partner who wants to help build a company with long-term potential in the fintech space.\n\nIf you’re interested, please send:\n\n* A short introduction\n* Relevant projects you’ve worked on\n* Your preferred tech stack\n* Whether you would be interested in a long-term founder journey\n\nLooking forward to connecting.",
