ng of Claude AI and practical business applications\n•\tExperience integrating multiple business platforms and systems\n•\tExperience with workflow automation tools and APIs\n•\tCommercial awareness and a practical, problem-solving mindset\n•\tAbility to communicate technical concepts clearly to non-technical teams\n\nEngagement\n•\tFreelance / project-based\n•\tRemote\n•\tInitial discovery and scoping phase required\n•\tPotential for ongoing collaboration depending on fit and outcomes\n\n\n**The original project couldn't proceed due to timeline constraints",
