          "contractorTier": "INTERMEDIATE",
          "currency": "USD",
          "description": "Join our team as a Business Operations & Profitability Consultant to enhance our MSP/IT services. You'll analyze current processes, identify inefficiencies, and implement strategies to boost profitability. Collaborate with our leadership team to develop and execute business plans, ensuring alignment with our vision and goals. Your expertise will help us optimize operations and drive growth.\n\n# Business Operations & Profitability Consultant (MSP / IT Services)\n\n## Overview\n\nWe are a growing IT services and managed services company seeking an experienced Business Operations & Profitability Consultant to conduct a complete operational review of our business.\n\nOur goal is not simply to increase revenue. We need an experienced professional who can identify inefficiencies, reduce waste, improve employee productivity, evaluate staffing levels, analyze client profitability, and increase overall company profit.\n\nThis is a short-term consulting engagement with the potential for ongoing advisory work.\n\n## Responsibilities\n\n* Review current organizational structure and staffing levels\n* Analyze employee productivity and utilization\n* Evaluate technician workload, ticket volume, and performance metrics\n* Review operational workflows and identify bottlenecks\n* Analyze profitability by client, service offering, and project\n* Identify areas of overspending and unnecessary operational costs\n* Review software subscriptions, tools, and recurring expenses\n* Evaluate pricing models and service agreements\n* Recommend automation opportunities and process improvements\n* Develop KPI dashboards and executive reporting\n* Provide a clear action plan to improve profitability and operational efficiency\n\n## Deliverables\n\nThe consultant will provide:\n\n1. Executive summary of findings\n2. Staffing analysis and recommendations\n3. Employee productivity assessment\n4. Client profitability analysis\n5. Service profitability analysis\n6. Cost reduction recommendations\n7. Process improvement recommendations\n8. KPI scorecard and reporting framework\n9. 90-day profitability improvement roadmap\n\n## Required Experience\n\n* Proven experience analyzing small to mid-sized service businesses\n* Experience with Managed Service Providers (MSPs), IT services, healthcare IT, or technology consulting firms preferred\n* Strong background in operations management\n* Financial analysis and business profitability experience\n* KPI and performance management expertise\n* Process improvement and operational optimization experience\n* Ability to provide actionable recommendations backed by data\n\n## Ideal Candidate\n\nWe're looking for someone who is comfortable challenging assumptions and identifying hard truths. The right consultant should be able to objectively determine:\n\n* Whether we are overstaffed or understaffed\n* Which clients are most profitable\n* Which services should be expanded or eliminated\n* Where productivity is being lost\n* How to improve margins without sacrificing service quality\n\n## Engagement\n\n* Initial engagement: 20–40 hours\n* Remote\n* Potential ongoing advisory relationship for implementation and accountability\n\nWhen applying, please include examples of businesses where you improved operational efficiency, reduced costs, increased productivity, or improved profitability.",
