          "contractorTier": "INTERMEDIATE",
          "currency": "USD",
          "description": "Hey there! We're DK Capital Ventures, a fast-scaling eCommerce company managing multiple high-growth Shopify brands.\n\nWe're on the hunt for a Performance Video Editor to join our team. Your mission? To collaborate closely with our creative director and media buyer to produce winning video ads that scale our brands to multiple 7 & 8-figures.\n\n🛑 Important! As much as we love growth & development, if you do NOT have direct experience editing short-form video ads AND hands-on experience with AI video creation tools, unfortunately, this role is not for you… But if you do 👇\n\n🌊 DK Capital Ventures runs multiple eCommerce brands with over $600,000 a month in active ad spend and growing fast. However, our creative output is maxed out. So, if we're going to continue scaling our brands and launching new ones, we need a sharp, hungry video editor to join our talented team — someone who treats every ad like it's their own money on the line.\n\n💰 Here's what makes this different from every other editing job: we pay for performance. You'll receive a competitive base salary PLUS uncapped performance bonuses tied to how well your creatives perform. Our top creators earn significantly more than a standard editor salary because when your ads win, you win. This isn't a clock-in, clock-out editing gig — it's a chance to build real wealth by making ads that convert.\n\n🤖 We're building an AI-first creative operation. If you're the kind of editor who's obsessed with the latest AI video tools and loves finding ways to produce more, faster, and better — you'll be in your element here. We want someone pushing the edge of what's possible with AI creative, not someone stuck doing everything the old way.\n\n🔎 Who Are We Looking For\nWe have one golden rule: you must have the DESIRE to grow. If you're not passionate about personal and professional growth, this isn't the company for you.\n\nThe purpose of the Performance Video Editor role at DK Capital Ventures is to produce high-converting video ads that stop the scroll, hold attention, and drive sales across our brands, not just look pretty.\n\nAs a Video Editor at DK Capital Ventures, you should possess proven experience editing short-form video content — ideally direct-response ads, UGC-style content, or social media ads that have actually run on Meta or TikTok. Critically, you have real hands-on experience with AI video creation tools (such as Runway, Sora, Kling, Veo, HeyGen, Arcads, or similar) and know how to use AI to produce, enhance, and scale ad creative fast. You know your way around Premiere Pro or CapCut, you understand pacing, hooks, captions, and how the first 3 seconds make or break an ad.\n\nIt is also important that you are coachable, fast, detail-obsessed, and hungry to win. Take feedback without ego, you hit deadlines without excuses, and you genuinely care whether your ads perform — not just whether they look pretty.\n\n📝 Your Responsibilities\n· Edit high-quality short-form video ads daily following creative briefs and SOPs.\n\n· Leverage AI video tools to generate, augment, and scale creative output rapidly.\n\n· Assemble modular ad variations (hooks, bodies, CTAs) into testable creatives at volume.\n\n· Collaborate with our creative director to refine and improve your output.\n\n· Apply feedback quickly and iterate on winning concepts to produce variations.\n\n· Stay on top of emerging AI video tools and techniques, and bring new methods to the team.\n\n· Maintain our brand style, pacing, and quality standards across every ad.\n\n· Organize and deliver all creatives on time using our file and naming systems.\n\n🌊 More Reasons to Join DK Capital Ventures\nAs a Performance Video Editor, you'll receive a competitive monthly base salary PLUS performance bonuses based on the results and ROAS of your videos. The better your ads perform, the more you earn. Our structure rewards winners: produce a creative that scales, you benefit from it not just us.\n\nPlus, you'll be trained directly by our creative director and gain access to our internal creative systems, frameworks, and SOPs — the exact playbook we use to produce winning ads. You'll level up faster here than anywhere else.\n\n📓 How Does This Work\nWe hold our team members to the highest standards and reward stellar work. Expect your earnings to rise rapidly as you excel. Ready to join us? Here's our hiring process:\n\n1. Loom Video introducing yourself and your editing experience (include 2-3 examples of ads you've edited).\n\n2. Culture & Values Interview.\n\n3. Paid Test Project — edit a real ad for one of our brands.\n\n4. Reference Check & Final Interview to finalize a possible offer.\n\nIf this resonates with you, let's chat! Choose the number associated with the core value you feel aligns with you the most and include it in your application. Looking forward to hearing from you!\n\nCORE VALUES:\n1 - 🏆 RESULTS OBSESSED\n\n2 - 🤏 ATTENTION TO DETAIL\n\n3 - ⚡️ ACCELERATED EXCELLENCE\n\n4 - 🫵 RELENTLESS OWNERSHIP\n\n5 - 📝 PREPARED TO WIN\n\n6 - 💡 COLLABORATIVE INNOVATION\n\n7 - 📈 NEVER NOT GROWING\nApply now and let's accomplish our goals together! 🌟",
