          "description": "Long-Term STR Virtual Assistant: Property Onboarding & Evening Support (160+ Listings)\n\nWe are a fast-growing short-term rental management company currently managing a portfolio of 160+ listings. We are heavy users of automation and property management software, and we are looking for a reliable, tech-savvy, and detail-oriented Virtual Assistant for a long-term, full-day role.\n\nIf you love the STR industry, know the tech tools inside out, and want a stable, long-term position with a supportive team, this is for you!\n\nWhat You Will Do\nThis role is a mix of technical property setups and live guest support, divided into two main areas:\n\n1. Property Onboarding & Mapping: You will set up and map new listings from scratch across our entire tech stack based on our guidelines. This includes Hostaway, PriceLabs, EnsoConnect, Pacho, Conduit, Booking.com, and Expedia etc..\n\n2. Guest & Owner Support: You will handle guest messaging, inquiries, and basic troubleshooting during our fixed evening shift (Finland Time / EET: 16:00 – 22:00 on weekdays, and 16:00 – 23:00 on Fridays & Saturdays).\n\nNote: You do NOT need to speak Finnish. All guest communication is done in English through Conduit, which automatically handles the translations.\n\nWhat We Are Looking For\nProven Software Experience: You must have active, hands-on experience with Hostaway and PriceLabs. Experience with EnsoConnect or Conduit is a massive plus.\n\nObsessive Attention to Detail: Mistakes in channel mapping or pricing syncs can be costly. We need someone who double-checks their work and ensures 100% accuracy.\n\nReliability & Availability: You must be fully available and alert during the specified shift hours (Finland evening time).\n\nProactive Attitude: We love people who don't just follow instructions but look for ways to optimize processes. If you have strengths in other areas (data analysis, marketing, etc.), we are open to expanding your role!\n\nWhat It’s Like to Work With Us\nClear Systems: We don’t leave you guessing. We provide clear guidelines and step-by-step instructions for our workflows.\n\nGreat Tech Stack: We invest in the best tools to make your job smoother and more automated.\n\nLong-Term Stability: We are looking for a true partner to grow with us. For the right person, this will be a steady, long-term income stream with a friendly, professional team.\n\nPlease apply with your resume, a brief summary of your experience with Hostaway/PriceLabs, and your best hourly rate for a dedicated role. To prove you read this entire post, please start your cover letter with the word \"Hostaway-pro\".\n\nLooking forward to working with you!",
