          "contractorTier": "EXPERT",
          "currency": "USD",
          "description": "Hello,\n\nWe are a skincare company seeking an experienced CFO or senior finance professional with proven experience in cosmetics, skincare, beauty, luxury consumer goods, wellness, or DTC brands to develop a comprehensive cost model for a premium skincare company preparing for launch.\n\nThe objective of this project is to identify, estimate, and organise all anticipated costs required to operate, scale, and grow the business.\n\nThe model will be used to support product pricing decisions, operational planning, profitability analysis, workforce planning (an organisational design will be provided), and long-term strategic decision-making.\n\nThe scope should include, but not be limited to:\n\n- Direct product costs\n- Indirect operating costs\n- Staffing and payroll costs (based on our business model, growth projections, and organisational design)\n- Manufacturing and production costs\n- Packaging and fulfilment costs\n- Regulatory and compliance costs\n- Marketing, PR, and customer acquisition costs\n- Technology and software costs\n- Logistics and warehousing costs\n- Research and development costs\n- Capital expenditure requirements\n- One-time launch costs\n- Ongoing recurring costs\n- Any additional costs identified as relevant to the successful operation and scaling of the business\n\nThe final model should provide a clear understanding of the company's cost structure and support sustainable growth while maintaining profitability.\n\nRequired Experience\n\n- Degree in Finance, Accounting, Economics, Business, or a related field\n- Minimum of 5 years of relevant professional experience\n- Demonstrated experience building cost models, budgets, financial plans, or operating models for cosmetics, skincare, beauty, wellness, luxury consumer goods, or DTC brands\n- Strong understanding of manufacturing, inventory management, fulfilment, regulatory requirements, marketing economics, and operational cost structures\n- Advanced financial modelling and analytical skills\n- Ability to identify both obvious and often-overlooked cost drivers within a growing consumer brand\n\nTo Apply\n\nPlease provide:\n\n- Relevant examples of similar projects completed (confidential information may be redacted)\n- A brief summary of your experience within the beauty, skincare, wellness, luxury consumer goods, or DTC sectors\n- An overview of your approach to developing a comprehensive cost model for an early-stage premium skincare company",
